<edge source="us_debt_bond_stress::asset_reallocation_flow" target="russia_ukraine_war::strike_campaign_intensit" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid reallocations into commodity assets (notably energy) push up oil and gas prices, increasing Russian export revenue and short-term liquidity that can be channeled into procurement, munitions consumption, and the tempo of long-range strike and drone operations.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_debt_bond_stress</data>
