  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Net shifts of capital out of bonds into commodity allocations bid up oil futures and prompt physical traders to draw inventories or cover shorts, raising benchmark crude prices within weeks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_debt_bond_stress</data>
