<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::strike_campaign_intensit" target="north_korea_nuclear::military_activity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained high-rate long-range strike and drone use in Ukraine prompts North Korean leadership to accelerate and publicize its own missile/rocket tests and launch activity to validate doctrines and signal deterrence.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">north_korea_nuclear</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::strike_campaign_intensit" target="us_china_tech_trade::crossborder_restriction" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">More intensive long-range and unmanned strikes produce clearer forensic evidence of dual‑use components and supply-chain links (e.g., commercial drone parts, avionics) traceable to Chinese suppliers, prompting targeted export restrictions and customs enforcement that raise cross-border limits on relevant tech flows to China.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::strike_campaign_intensit" target="us_debt_bond_stress::long_term_yields" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained uptick in long-range strike intensity raises the probability of broader commodity and supply shocks and increases term premium and inflation expectations, pushing up long-term government bond yields.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_debt_bond_stress</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::strike_campaign_intensit" target="us_iran_gulf_conflict::crude_price_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in long‑range and drone strikes that damages export terminals, raises the odds of further disruption, and increases insurance and risk premia for tanker routes causes immediate upward pressure on benchmark crude prices independent of an exact measured physical shortfall.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
</edge>
