  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Severe damage to Black Sea export infrastructure forces crude and refined product exporters to reroute cargoes away from Ukrainian/Black Sea ports toward Gulf suppliers, increasing the number and volume of tankers transiting Middle Eastern chokepoints (e.g., Strait of Hormuz).</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
