  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">U.S. escalation of sanctions and secondary-sanctions authorities against Iranian entities leads Commerce/Treasury to broaden export controls and licensing requirements (including tighter end‑user/end‑use checks), which raises de facto barriers on cross‑border movement of AI‑related goods and tech involving Chinese intermediaries.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
