  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained higher crude prices materially raise Russian hydrocarbon revenues and budgetary headroom, enabling faster procurement/consumption of munitions and fuel that support a higher tempo of long-range strike and drone campaigns.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
