  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Heightened kinetic/coercive activity in the Gulf draws U.S. and allied command attention and forces into the region and degrades deterrence signaling in Europe, which Russia exploits to intensify reciprocal probing and provocative operations against Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
