  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in North Korean missile tests and exercises forces U.S. and allied naval/air assets to redeploy toward Northeast Asia, creating a temporary deterrence gap in the Gulf that raises the probability of kinetic or coercive escalation involving U.S.-Iranian actors and proxies.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
